:</p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li>Compare multiple restaurant locations before making an offer</li>\n    <li>Identify underperforming restaurants with turnaround potential</li>\n    <li>Validate asking prices with data-driven location scores</li>\n    <li>Scout new restaurant locations in Phoenix neighborhoods</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>CLEANBI Grading Scale for Restaurants</h2>\n  \n  <table class="grade-table">\n    <tr><th>Grade</th><th>Score</th><th>Meaning for Phoenix Restaurants</th></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>A</strong></td><td>90-100</td><td>Excellent location - prime Phoenix restaurant opportunity</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>B</strong></td><td>80-89</td><td>Strong location - above average for Arizona restaurants</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>C</strong></td><td>70-79</td><td>Average location - due diligence required</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><strong>Needs Work</strong></td><td>Below 70</td><td>Turnaround opportunity - significant improvements needed</td></tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <h2>How to Use CLEANBI for Phoenix Restaurant Analysis</h2>\n  \n  <ol>\n    <li><strong>Enter the Address</strong> - Type any Phoenix, AZ restaurant address into CLEANBI</li>\n    <li><strong>Get Instant Score</strong> - Receive your 0-100 score with A-F grade in seconds</li>\n    <li><strong>Review Breakdown</strong> - Analyze foot traffic, competition, reviews, and location factors</li>\n    <li><strong>Compare Locations</strong> - Score multiple Phoenix restaurants to find the best opportunity</li>\n    <li><strong>Get Full Report</strong> - Upgrade to our $97 premium report for deep analysis and valuations</li>\n  </ol>\n\n  <div class="cta-box">\n    <h3>Ready to Score Phoenix Restaurants?</h3>\n    <p>100% free. No login required. Works for any restaurant address in Arizona.</p>\n    <a href="/cleanbi-explorer" class="cta-button">Try CLEANBI Explorer Free →</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n  \n  <div class="faq-section">\n    <h3>Is CLEANBI free for Phoenix restaurant