pace is required for an ATM?**\n\n    A: The space required for an ATM depends on the type of machine. A standard freestanding ATM typically requires a floor space of about 2 feet by 2 feet. A wall-mounted ATM requires less floor space.\n\n*   **Q: What are the legal requirements for ATMs in New York?**\n\n    A: ATMs in New York must comply with ADA (Americans with Disabilities Act) guidelines for accessibility. They must also display clear signage indicating the surcharge amount. ATM Depot ensures that all our ATMs meet these requirements.\n\n*   **Q: Is my motel suitable for an ATM?**\n\n    A: Most New York motels are suitable for an ATM. Factors that increase the likelihood of success include high occupancy rates, location in a high-traffic area, proximity to tourist attractions or transportation hubs, and a lack of nearby ATMs.\n\nDon't miss out on the opportunity to enhance your New York motel and boost your bottom line with a FREE ATM from ATM Depot. Contact us today to learn more!\n\n[Get Your Free ATM for Your Motel](https://atmdepot.com/laundromat)\n	ai_generated	atm_placement	f	t	0	2025-11-26 00:23:25.649927	Discover why Motels in New York are adding ATMs. Free placement, earn per transaction. Get your free ATM from ATM Depot today!	atm-for-motel-new-york	https://atmdepot.com/blog/atm-for-motel-new-york	Why Every Motel in New York Needs an ATM Machine	Discover why Motels in New York are adding ATMs. Free placement, earn per transaction. Get your free ATM from ATM Depot today!	["ATM for motel New York", "New York motel ATM machine", "ATM placement motel"]	Why Every Motel in New York Needs an ATM Machine	Discover why Motels in New York are adding ATMs. Free placement, earn per transaction. Get your free ATM from ATM Depot today!	\N	summary_large_image	Why Every Motel in New York Needs an ATM Machine	Discover why Motels in New York are adding ATMs. Free placement, earn per transaction. Get your free ATM from ATM Depot today!	\N	"{\\"@context\\":\\"https://s