dexter-vended-catalog-2024	Dexter Laundry Vended Solutions Catalog 2024	Complete product catalog featuring Dexter's full line of commercial washers, dryers, and management systems for vended laundry operations. Includes detailed specifications for C-Series and X-Series equipment, DexterLive cloud management, DexterPay cashless payment integration, and comparison charts. Dexter equipment is designed, built, and assembled in the USA at their Fairfield, Iowa headquarters with industry-leading warranties and lifetime technical support.	dexter-vended-laundry-catalog-2024	catalog	technical	{owner,investor,distributor,technician}	{researching,planning,acquiring,operating}	## Dexter Laundry Vended Solutions\n\n### About Dexter Laundry\nSince 1894, Dexter Laundry has been dedicated to helping people and companies around the world process laundry faster and more efficiently. As an employee-owned company, their success depends on yours.\n\n### Product Lines\n\n#### Washers (20lb - 120lb capacity)\n- **X-Series**: Touchscreen interface, leak detection, programmable cycles, gentle tumble options\n- **C-Series**: Button-based interface, standard programming, PLUS cycles available\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Heavy duty bearings in cast iron housing\n- Welded steel spider & shaft\n- Stainless steel tub, cylinder, top & front\n- 200G Express Extract\n- Industry-leading warranties\n- Lifetime technical support\n\n#### Dryers (20lb - 120lb capacity)\n- Gas or electric models\n- Reversing tumbler options\n- X-Series Moisture Detection System (MDS) saves time and gas\n- Level 1 Fire Response System (X-Series)\n\n### Technology\n- **DexterLive**: Cloud-based management system\n- **DexterPay**: Mobile payment app for cashless transactions\n- Custom programming via cloud dashboard\n\n### Download Full Catalog\n[Download PDF - Complete specifications, sizing guides, and pricing](/attached_assets/en-vended-laundry-catalog_(1)_1765309791779.pdf)	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	free	\N	{dexter,washers,dryers,vended,commercial,coin-op,x-series,c-series,dexterlive,dexterpay,equipment,specifications}	beginner	15	t	0	0	0	\N	0	Dexter Laundry Vended Equipment Catalog 2024 | Commercial Washers & Dryers | WashBizHub	Download the complete Dexter Laundry vended solutions catalog. Compare C-Series and X-Series commercial washers and dryers with specifications, features, and pricing for your laundromat.	2025-12-09 19:51:55.300979	2025-12-09 19:51:55.300979
